{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Charcoal Kiln is a piece of ",["l","打造#Refining Equipment","equipment"]," used to burn ",["l","木材","Wood"]," into ",["l","煤炭","Coal"],". Coal is used in several ",["l","打造","Crafting"]," recipes, and to smelt different metals into their respective bars."]],["p",["It takes 30m (≈23 seconds ",["l","游戏内时间","real-time"],") to change the Wood into Coal. For every 10 Wood, you will get 1 Coal."]],["p",["It can also be obtained by completing the Crafts Room (198 ",["l","木材","wood"],", 99 ",["l","石头","stone"],", 10 ",["l","硬木","hardwood"],"), the Forest Bundle, or the Sticky Bundle."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.07","1.07"],": Changed requirement for 1 ",["l","煤炭","coal"]," from 20 ",["l","木材","wood"]," to 10 wood."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Changed recipe from 1 ",["l","金锭","Gold Bar"]," to 2 ",["l","铜锭","Copper Bar"],"s. Charcoal Kilns can now be stacked in a player's ",["l","物品栏","inventory"]," and in ",["l","宝箱","chest"],"s."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Recipe is now learned at ",["l","技能#Foraging","Foraging"]," Level 2 instead of Level 4."]]]]]]],"f":[["Source",[["l","打造","Crafting"]]],["Ingredients",[["i","(O)388","Wood ×20"],["i","(O)334","Copper Bar ×2"]]],["Sell Price",["Cannot be sold"]]]}